{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_001_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "41cac6b87a2334d2c88cf8479a3af5aa5c8815759da37eeb5aeb6764d7b20ee1", "ja": "歴史の教科書に載りたいと思ったからです～。", "zh": "因为我想要被记载在历史课本上～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f20f063f870a6bad87e1b77ec0e7036a3c6be1dc7fd93909c6380ddd32310ab7", "ja": "えっ……れ、歴史の教科書！？", "zh": "什么……历、历史课本！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
