{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_001_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "ce2b110a69c976c06c2bd6e8ea741de3041c249ab0a216f31314f58dcd5dc92a", "ja": "『新しいアイドルが世界の歴史を変える！』\nと～。", "zh": "『崭新的偶像将会改变世界的历史！』\n是这样写的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3e29c205bb2aa03aac9504e06fefea45cdca1c9fc9126782a988619709e64016", "ja": "そういえば、社長がそんなキャッチコピーを\nつけていたような……。", "zh": "这么说来，\n社长好像真的有加上那句标语……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_001_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "6fd6e69c3ff25d4959a40a0c5bc17418bf576e12631027bc39379d15836a6788", "ja": "見た瞬間、これだと思ったんです～。\n私も、絶対に参加しないと、って～。", "zh": "我一看到就下定决心了～\n我一定要参加甄选～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_001_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "f7f95d514a40cf5f1a504896ca1e9229ba65e5a8b5f62820bf9c4ad88c4ae04c", "ja": "アイドルになったら、歴史の教科書に\n自分の名前が載る……ってことですよね～？", "zh": "只要当上偶像，\n就能在历史课本上留名……是这样没错吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "77e23d951018702380d05f4f9ebe5428633893e1ca48f104192fc21fc33fa7d2", "ja": "な、なるほど。あのキャッチコピーを\nそういうふうに解釈したんだね……。", "zh": "我、我懂了，原来你把那句标语\n解读成这种意思吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_001_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "80a7c818be5c923ef24da2288a62f8007a3b63efbdfca88613ebb7775b1e883d", "ja": "はい～。それに、アイドルのお仕事は、\nみんなを楽しい気持ちにさせることだと思って～。", "zh": "是的～而且，\n我觉得偶像的工作是让大家都能开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
